      "accessed": "2026-11-22",
      "note": "Left side from below, landing, 2026-07-28: fitted to shapes/A388.json (nose, tail, fin tip, the first and last main-deck doors; within 35 px, about 1.5 m at the tail). The red sweep, the black band and the white line between them measured on it; the red block's top seen over the wing."
    },
    {
      "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Emirates_Airlines_(UAE_Flag_Livery)_Airbus_A380-800_-_A6-EVG.jpg",
      "title": "Emirates Airlines (UAE Flag Livery) Airbus A380-800 - A6-EVG.jpg (Umedha Hettigoda, CC BY-SA 4.0)",
      "accessed": "2026-11-22",
      "note": "Right side, taking off at Auckland, 2026-07-01, flipped nose-left and fitted the same way (within 34 px): the red block, the green along the crown and the black's top measured on it; the same layout as the left."
    },
    {
      "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:(GBR-Greater_Manchester)_Emirates_Airbus_A380-842_A6-EVG_@_EGCC_2025-06-09.jpg",
